{"id":"396312","name":"三文鱼豆腐羹","author":"小耿妈妈","authorId":"407931","desc":"","cover":"images/396312/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"三文鱼","amount":"150克"},{"name":"内酯豆腐","amount":"1盒"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备的原料。","img":"images/396312/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐切小块淡盐水浸泡半小时去除豆腥味。","img":"images/396312/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱，姜剁碎。","img":"images/396312/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"三文鱼切小块。","img":"images/396312/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅凉油，煸香葱，姜煸香。","img":"images/396312/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入三文鱼块。","img":"images/396312/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煸炒十几秒。","img":"images/396312/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入豆腐块，清水。","img":"images/396312/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烧开，加盐，胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/396312/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再淋上少许的水淀粉烧开就可以。","img":"images/396312/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"三文鱼豆腐羹就做好了。","img":"images/396312/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"1.豆腐加盐水浸泡可以去除豆腥味。\n2.加点胡椒粉可以增香去腥。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}